-- The power function X ↦ Xⁿ as a real function, its continuity and
-- derivative, the chain rule, and congruence of derivatives under
-- pointwise equality: the analytic tools the polynomial functions need.
-- Part of the CAD blueprint.
-- Planned home: Real/Analysis/Polynomial.
